  dialogue:
    sentences:
    - Hello there! Welcome to the Drone Training Simulator!
    - I'll be your guide, teaching you all the controls of how to fly our drone.
    - 'First, how about we start with some basic controls? '
    - I'll provide you the whole space of the hall so that you can learn all the
      basics!
    - Lets Try Simply moving forwards, backwards and side to side.
